   "keyIdea": "After each queen move, look at what it attacks and cover it; then develop with moves that hit the queen, so it keeps losing time.",
   "text": "You are Black, from White's first move. White brings the queen out early. At each move, ask what the queen attacks now and how you can cover it while you bring out your pieces.",
